  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diakonia Colombia 2021-2025 - Diakonia Core Colombia 2021-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diakonia Colombia 2021-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching goal of Diakonias country strategy for Colombia is to mobilise society for peacebuilding, making the conditions for peace a national priority. In particular, the organisation identifies the holistic implementation of existing peace accords, strengthened guarantees for the protection and safety of civil society organisations and the initiation of new peace-talks, as such prioritised conditions for peace. 

To achieve this, Diakonia proposes to strengthen and to work together with local civil society organisations to generate significant changes and structural transformations in four interrelated areas or change processes, each with its own set of objectives and results indicators:

1. Strengthened capacity of civil society to exercise democratic participation, defence of human rights and active citizenship.
2. Implementation of the peace agreements, new peace-talks and national reconciliation.
3. Increased gender equality in social, economic and political structures.
4. Environmental justice and defence of the right to a healthy environment</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;det till Diakonia i Colombia syftar till att bidra till en stabil och varaktig fred i landet med ett nationellt, territoriellt och r&#xe4;ttighetsbaserat perspektiv. Detta st&#xf6;d &#xe4;r en forts&#xe4;ttning av en tidigare insats med ID 10781. De &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;len &#xe4;r f&#xf6;ljande:

1) St&#xe4;rkt kapacitet hos det civila samh&#xe4;llet att ut&#xf6;va demokratiskt deltagande, f&#xf6;rsvar av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och aktivt medborgarskap.
2) Genomf&#xf6;rande av fredsavtalet, nya fredssamtal och nationell f&#xf6;rsoning.
3) &#xd6;kad j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet i sociala, ekonomiska och politiska strukturer.
4) Milj&#xf6;r&#xe4;ttvisa och f&#xf6;rsvar av r&#xe4;tten till en h&#xe4;lsosam milj&#xf6;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to Diakonia cointains two components; a core funding to the country plan; and a project support to a civil society fund. The components aim at contributing to a stable and lasting peace in Colombia with a national, territorial, and right-based perspective. The overall objectives are the following:

1) Strengthened capacity of civil society to exercise democratic participation, defence of human rights and active citizenship.
2) Implementation of the peace agreement, new peace-talks, and national reconciliation.
3) Increased gender equality in social, economic, and political structures.
4) Environmental justice and defence of the right to a healthy environment.

This support is a continuation of previous contribution with ID-number 10781.</narrative>
  </description>
